\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy Ghost, my Comforter,
\par Now from highest heaven appear,
\par Shed Thy gracious radiance here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come, to them who suffer dearth,
\par With Thy gifts of priceless worth,
\par Lighten all who dwell on earth.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou, the heart's most precious Guest,
\par Thou, of comforters the best,
\par Give to us, the o'er-laden rest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Come! In Thee our toil is sweet,
\par Shelter from the noonday heat,
\par From whom sorrow flieth fleet.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Blessed Sun of grace, o'er all
\par Faithful hearts who on Thee call
\par Let Thy light and solace fall.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. What without Thy aid is wrought,
\par Skilful deed or wisest thought,
\par God will count but vain and nought.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Cleanse us, Lord, from sinful stain,
\par O'er the parched heart O rain!
\par Heal the wounded of its pain.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Bend the stubborn will to Thine,
\par Melt the cold with fire divine, 
\par Erring hearts aright incline.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. Grant us, Lord, who cry to Thee,
\par Steadfast in the faith to be,
\par Give Thy gift of charity.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10. May we live in holiness,
\par And in death find happiness
\par And abide with Thee in bliss. \tab 
\par                                   Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

